Cell["\<\
If both are used at the same time, the interval between the time points must \
be consistent with the duration of the event:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.5453883624832153`*^9, 3.545388378858416*^9}, {
  3.5453884314789133`*^9, 3.5453884554151907`*^9}, {3.7892988927573986`*^9, 
