Cell["\<\
TransformationAmplitudeTable supports any number of variable parameters, \
together with EnsembleAverage if needed.  \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.721951388458702*^9, 
  3.72195143080203*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e029a65e-c7ee-4a9b-ad15-\
863834c18276"]
}, Closed]]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["MaximizeTransformationAmplitude", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.5443597793686047`*^9, 3.544359848250125*^9}, 
   3.544463309307725*^9, {3.74429408366085*^9, 3.744294087843377*^9}},
 Background->RGBColor[0.94, 0.88, 0.94],
 CellTags->
  "TransformationAmplitudeTable",ExpressionUUID->"1ee5db58-3df8-46fd-839d-\
fabdc79f73f5"],

Cell["\<\
MaximizeTransformationAmplitude enables numerical optimization of a \
TransformationAmplitude by adjusting the values of one or more parameters. A \
common application is to optimize the performance of a pulse sequence by \
adjusting pulse flip angles, phases, or the durations of delays. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.544595676670926*^9, 3.544595734821675*^9}, 
   3.544597064410241*^9, {3.744294099301424*^9, 3.7442942185975537`*^9}, {
   3.744296819464892*^9, 3.744296821954455*^9}},
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.94, 0.88, 0.94],ExpressionUUID->"4bd9b428-e197-411e-bfde-3424101f9c6a"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["basic functionality; unconstrained optimization", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.544595756798325*^9, 3.544595759461074*^9}, {
  3.7219504539442663`*^9, 3.72195046912052*^9}, {3.744294848686954*^9, 
  3.744294852984373*^9}},
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.94, 0.88, 0.94],ExpressionUUID->"6a2d15e3-098b-4469-a4e6-313255ab4cfd"],

Cell["\<\
The basic syntax of MaximizeTransformationAmplitude is as follows:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.544595848523198*^9, 3.544595860873725*^9}, {
   3.54459590574984*^9, 3.5445959064413977`*^9}, 3.744294233847397*^9},
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.94, 0.88, 0.94],ExpressionUUID->"a13460b6-53ff-47f1-aa39-2fa7ca916386"],

Cell["\<\
MaximizeTransformationAmplitude[a\[Rule]b, events, {{p1,p1ini},{p2,pini}..} \
options]\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.5445958642886257`*^9, 3.544595901401365*^9}, {
  3.744294236350815*^9, 3.744294264019548*^9}},
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.94, 0.88, 0.94],ExpressionUUID->"440dd11d-afed-490e-8e0a-3949e6821bba"],

Cell["\<\
where a is the initial density operator, b is the target density operator, \
events contains the specifications for the evolution events, and {p1,p2..} \
are the parameters which are to be adjusted. The values {p1ini,p2ini..} are \
the starting values for the optimization. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.544595914206235*^9, 3.544596011941909*^9}, {
  3.544596042564815*^9, 3.544596095514714*^9}, {3.7095479288337884`*^9, 
  3.7095479290127664`*^9}, {3.7095482854886904`*^9, 3.7095482866102877`*^9}, {
  3.744294277823698*^9, 3.744294366453083*^9}},
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.94, 0.88, 0.94],ExpressionUUID->"9dad54a9-ee44-4b21-af98-57c49fd17afe"],

Cell["\<\
MaximizeTransformationAmplitude searches for a local maximum, so the solution \
that it finds will depend on the starting point given by {p1ini,p2ini..}. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.544595914206235*^9, 3.544596011941909*^9}, {
  3.544596042564815*^9, 3.544596095514714*^9}, {3.7095479288337884`*^9, 
  3.7095479290127664`*^9}, {3.7095482854886904`*^9, 3.7095482866102877`*^9}, {
  3.744294277823698*^9, 3.744294440737502*^9}},
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.94, 0.88, 0.94],ExpressionUUID->"a2c7f06b-05bd-4e53-ab37-f504a4d6c515"],

Cell["\<\
The output of MaximizeTransformationAmplitude has the form {val,rules} where \
val is the optimized value of the TransformationAmplitude, and rules \
specifies the optimized values of the parameters {p1,p2..}.  \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.544596111027958*^9, 3.544596160952854*^9}, {
  3.7442944564566317`*^9, 3.744294554784088*^9}},
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.94, 0.88, 0.94],ExpressionUUID->"fe1cc767-e762-4bb8-8212-71ccf591fb27"],

Cell["\<\
For example, the following syntax shows the optimization of a pulse flip \
angle in order to maximize the inversion of z-magnetization:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.544596111027958*^9, 3.544596160952854*^9}, {
  3.7442944564566317`*^9, 3.744294471499875*^9}, {3.74429456368593*^9, 
  3.7442945684997797`*^9}},
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.94, 0.88, 0.94],ExpressionUUID->"6b145510-2162-4750-878b-c013336f36de"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"SetSpinSystem", "[", "1", "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{"MaximizeTransformationAmplitude", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"opI", "[", "\"\<z\>\"", "]"}], "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"-", 
     RowBox[{"opI", "[", "\"\<z\>\"", "]"}]}]}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{"Pulse", "[", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\[Beta]", ",", "\"\<x\>\""}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", 
   "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"\[Beta]", ",", "0.01"}], "}"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.5445961686990156`*^9, 3.544596213700069*^9}, {
  3.5742628445154347`*^9, 3.574262848672704*^9}, {3.7095482953817887`*^9, 
  3.709548296627407*^9}, {3.721950407985839*^9, 3.72195043326775*^9}, {
  3.744294573951407*^9, 3.74429469384774*^9}, {3.744542881208067*^9, 
