Cell["\<\
If Signal1D generates a spectrum of unexpected appearance, the timing \
parameters should be examined carefully to see if the spectrum is folded. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.5742655521751633`*^9, 
  3.574265575615797*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"1575a91b-ff82-468f-984b-\
238339235a26"]
}, Closed]],

