Cell["\<\
In these examples, small peaks are obtained at the positions of the \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]wrong\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] spins, as a by-product \
of the strong coupling. These are not computational errors.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.574264046866465*^9, 3.574264073625953*^9}, {
  3.574264148394193*^9, 
  3.574264160936087*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ffa6c8d7-799b-478d-9071-\
697f454b8d6f"],

