Cell["\<\
Note the adjustment of the sampling interval, and that the periodic \
time-dependent modulation gives rise to modulation sidebands in the spectrum. \
Spinning sidebands in liquids and solids may be simulated this way.  \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.54495757034486*^9, 3.544957597385602*^9}, {
