Cell["\<\
If the number of repetitions in Repeat is omitted, the repetitions are \
assumed to fill out the entire detection interval. The fast COMPUTE algorithm \
is used in this case:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.544965175332732*^9, 3.544965211317807*^9}, {
   3.544965377889639*^9, 3.5449654515481157`*^9}, {3.574843808565075*^9, 
